        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Night Latch Function Handleset for Panic Device</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a Night Latch Function Handleset (turning key opens door) for all Wide and Medium Stile Doors (aluminum framed, hollow metal, or wood).  For use on door's exterior with <a href=\"/collections/panic-devices\"><b>Panic Device Hardware</b></a>.  Covers standard 2-1/8\" bore hole prep. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nFor use with PDQ <a href=\"/products/grade-1-commercial-exit-device-for-30-36-inch-door-pdq-4200r\"><b>4200 Series Rim Exit Device</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/grade-1-commercial-vertical-rod-exit-device-for-30-36-inch-door-pdq-4200v\"><b>4200 Series Vertical Rod Exit Device</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/grade-1-polished-brass-vertical-rod-exit-device-pdq-4200v-b605\"><b>Polished Brass Vertical Rod Exit Device</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/grade-1-polished-brass-rim-exit-device-pdq-4200r-b605\"><b>Polished Brass Rim Exit Device</b></a>, \r\n Global <a href=\"/products/30-to-36-inch-wide-door-touch-bar-rim-exit-device-th1100edtbar\"><b>TH1100EDTBAR Touch Bar Rim Exit Device</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/30-to-36-inch-grade-2-surface-vertical-rod-door-panic-device-th1100edsvtbar\"><b>TH1100EDSVTBAR Surface Vertical Rod Panic Device</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with rim lock cylinder, mounting hardware, instructions, and 2 keys.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for PDQ 4-GW-03 Night Latch  Handleset \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Night Latch Function (ANSI F03) - Outside entrance by lever when latch bolt is retracted by Key. (Lever only opens door when the key is turned). Key removable only when locked (Night Latch).</li>\r\n<li>Handle Plate Height: 12-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Handle Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Height: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Projection: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Supplied with Lock Cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Supplied with 2 keys</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/429GPG.pdf?v=1704262276\" target=\"new\"><b>PDQ 4-GW-03 Installation Template & Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in your choice of powder coated Aluminum, Dark Bronze (Duro) or plated Polished Brass.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Panic Device Night Latch Handleset, PDQ 4-GW-03",
                "description": "PDQ 4-GW-03 Night Latch Function Handleset (Entry by turning key. Key does NOT unlock panic exit device. Key unlatches the exit devise when turned so you can open the door. ) For use with PDQ 4200 Touch Bar Rim Exit Devices, PDQ 4200 Vertical Rod Exit Device and other manufactures Panic Devices. Available in Aluminum, Dark Bronze (Duro) or Polished Brass finish. Packaged with rim lock cylinder, mounting hardware, instructions, and 2 keys.",
